      "content": "but it's not just \"pain\" though. it's the reality of it. there is no \"weathering the storm\" when the storm is just the state of things now. there's no more social life, no more community, no more future where I'm not just this shadow person. i'm basically just waiting for a life that's already over. it feels like the only honest thing left to do is just accept that i'm already gone.",
